Pyo's changes to voxl's web page, for the desktop sandbox.

- Pyo's icons: favicon.svg next to favicon.ico (desktop.py serves both).
- Pyo's loading screen: its mark over "Connecting…". It goes away with
  a 120 ms fade on the first frame the page shows (the worker says when,
  as status "shown"). After a drop it waits a second before it shows
  "Reconnecting…", so a quick reconnect never shows it.
- The tab's title gets the sandbox's name from ?name=, as
  "Desktop | <name>".
- Messages for browsers that can't play the desktop don't name voxl.
- voxl's copyright and license notice in the page and in every script
  it loads, which esbuild keeps (/*! comments).

Applied with git apply to voxl 0.3.5 (commit 93ad2d4839a3d1a9086a07307bfe66baa75f2504)
when the image builds. Same license as voxl: MIT.

